WEBVTT

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.190
Onii-chan...

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:12.150
Onii-chan!

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.570
Wait for me, Onii-chan!

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.750
So, um...

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.350
Sorry.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.010
If you don't want to, that's okay.

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:04.850
I...

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:06.560
I like y...

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.810
I mean, I would like you to...

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:10.150
Well...

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.090
Huh?

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:12.920
Is that you, Moa?

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:14.670
What do you think you're doing?

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.650
Huh? What's going on? Speak up.

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:20.590
What's up? Hey.

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:24.620
I get it! She messed up somehow!

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:28.710
We're sorry. She's too much of an idiot.

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:31.680
Hey, stop that! Get lost!

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.540
So how did you screw up <i>this</i> time?

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.690
Uh, she didn't do anything wrong.

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:39.300
Anyway, who are you?

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.160
Who, me?

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.300
Torii Shoutarou,

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.310
her older brother!

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.000
Oh my god!

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:54.080
Why did you have to pick that route to come home? You're usually nowhere near it!

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:58.280
Yuuya wanted to buy a cake from a nearby café.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.390
Besides, it's none of your business which route I take...

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:03.280
Whatever! Are you <i>that</i> seriously oblivious?

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:06.910
I thought you pissed someone off.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.830
You had it all wrong!

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:11.210
No.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:15.070
Shimazu-san is a college student who works at a café.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:17.670
Welcome!

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:18.840
Table for two?

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:20.720
Oh, yes.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.430
I'll show you to your seats.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:31.130
I totally fell for that wonderful
smile and gentlemanly manner.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:35.160
I kept spending my allowance
so that I can go to that café.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:37.880
We even knew each other by name.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:41.110
Today I finally, finally gathered up my nerve to ask...

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:44.070
if we can go see a movie together!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.730
But you just <i>had</i> to come along...

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:48.850
You won those in the neighborhood lottery, didn't you?

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:51.640
Let it go! It's not like it cost you anything!

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:53.120
You're missing the point!

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:58.650
Anyways, a college student would never hook up with a little girl like you!

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:00.090
I'm not little!

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.410
And Shimazu-san's not like that!

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:06.730
Forget it, little girl! You still wear baby-chick undies!

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:09.520
What? I don't wear those!

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:10.100
Oh?

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.160
What're you doing, Baldy?

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.080
I'm not going bald!

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.810
I hope you <i>do</i> go bald!

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.400
I won't go bald!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:19.730
Oh?

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.360
I guess it wasn't a baby chick after all!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.580
Quit it!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.170
A "woman" wearing teddy-bear panties? A teddy bear?

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:28.740
What are you doing?! Let go of me right now!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:32.120
Aren't you taking it a little too
far? I'm starting to feel for her.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.960
Dumb Onii!

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:39.590
You bald jerk! Chrome Dome!

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:44.550
I'm not... bald.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:50.970
What does she mean, "Shimazu-san's not like that"?!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.330
They all have one thing on their minds!

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:56.070
You can't judge people by their looks!

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:57.520
I know, but...

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.330
I didn't get any sketchy vibes.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:01.440
You're just saying that based on looks!

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:03.810
That girl just doesn't get it!

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:08.420
Fooling around with a college student only leads to trouble!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.330
But she's the only one who'll be affected.

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:16.490
I swear, you fuss over her too much.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:19.030
What? I don't fuss over anybody!

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:20.250
Sure, whatever.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:24.800
Take a look.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.800
Shimazu-san just gave the okay for our movie date.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:32.570
Ah, what shall I wear?

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.900
Yuuya, are you free Sunday?

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:43.290
Mommy, I want some popcorn!

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.820
Okay, what kind do you want?

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:45.840
Caramel!

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:48.810
Morning, Moa-chan.

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:50.160
Good morning.

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:51.620
Did I keep you?

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.080
Not at all!

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:58.040
Look, that stupid twink actually showed up.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.520
I swear to god that's a lolicon!

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:03.050
So, why am I even here?

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:06.300
I need you for backup in case something goes down.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.890
So you're assuming something <i>will</i> go down?

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:10.640
Come on, let's move!

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:18.420
I don't care if we anger the BPO,

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:19.900
I want to hold you.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.120
I'm so happy!

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:24.570
I hope this joy I'm feeling right now can last forever.

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:27.820
Even if they move us to late nights, our love lasts forever.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.020
That was great!

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.450
I couldn't stop crying!

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:37.130
That was a very nice story.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:39.980
The couple at the end were really moving.

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:41.130
I know!

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.190
Hold on.

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:47.180
You're easily moved to tears, aren't you, Moa-chan.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:51.010
Oh... no, I'm fine. Thank you.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:52.180
I can't believe I was crying. This is embarrassing.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:55.310
What the hell? Do people even do that?!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.270
Actually, that <i>was</i> a real tearjerker.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.720
Yow!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.380
There's someplace I want to take you.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.090
Sure, I'd love to come!

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.320
Thanks.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.930
Shimazu-san! Come here!

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:41.140
Yeah, I'd say she's fine.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:42.900
It looks like they're having fun.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:49.070
Hey, now. What gives?!

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.510
Why are they going in <i>there?!</i>

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:53.880
Probably to use the restroom.

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.450
The hell they are!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:58.370
Look, you know what people do at hotels?

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:04.920
Don't!

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.630
Help!

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:11.590
Onii...

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.590
chan!

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:14.470
Moa!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:16.810
That idiot!

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:20.560
Moa!

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:23.820
Huh? Onii? Why are you...

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.400
What?

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:29.020
Wait, were you following me?!

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:31.780
I... I wasn't following anybody!

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.490
I was walking with Yuuya
when I saw you go in here!

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.680
And so what if I came in here?!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:41.180
"So what" my butt! You're in middle school!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.210
Can you wait just a second?

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.360
You're taking her home without hearing her out?

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:48.460
That's too high-handed, even for an older brother.

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:52.420
I didn't come specifically to call off the date.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.950
But she's still a little girl.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:59.370
She even wears teddy-bear panties.
She's just a little kid with no sex appeal.

00:08:59.370 --> 00:08:59.970
Hey!

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.010
So please...

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.990
can I ask you not to do this?

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:08.690
My sister is still a child in middle school.

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:16.360
You have a good, reliable brother, Moa-chan.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:22.330
Don't worry. We didn't come
here for any unseemly purpose.

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:25.840
We came here... for that.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.130
A hotel... café?

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:32.510
Oh yeah, that café's famous for their cakes.

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:35.030
Yeah, so what exactly is the problem?

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:38.430
Wait, I mean hotels are usually used for...

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.100
Oh, and FYI...

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:45.310
In case you have the wrong idea, I'm a woman.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.480
Onii! Keep it down!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.970
Man, I'm so sorry! Believe me!

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:55.610
No, it's fine.

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:59.830
Everyone knows Shimazu-san is a cross-dressing hottie at that café.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:03.090
I know, right? I thought he knew too.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:06.040
I can't believe he'd butt in like this.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.090
I'm sorry for acting worried and copping an attitude with you!

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:10.580
Yeah, but he was really worried about you.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.220
He... was?

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:16.170
Mm-hmm. Even I was impressed.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:20.800
He may curse at me and fight with me every day,

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:24.350
but he still worries about me, like in the past.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:28.230
I know that side of him the best.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:41.070
So an older onee-san, eh?

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:44.830
Maybe this spells a beginning for me.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.150
A beginning of an adult romance!

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:53.130
Seriously, go bald!

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:53.850
Bald?

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:56.680
What's that got to do with anything? Moa?!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:13.560
This year, the Christmas illumination at Misakura Station is lighting up.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:18.530
The town's truly in the holiday
spirit, awaiting the new year.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:21.610
A lot of families and couples have come to gather at the station.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:24.240
Mitsuki, Kyouko-san sent us an email.

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:26.060
And over here, a woman wearing a Santa suit
Did you read it?

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.700
Just did.
And over here, a woman wearing a Santa suit

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.620
is selling Christmas cakes.

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:32.670
Christmas Eve is around the corner!

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:36.170
Which means we have to do a Christmas party!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.450
A Christmas party?

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:43.770
That's right. We gotta end the year
with cakes, treats, and a huge bang!

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:45.590
I'm okay with that.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:47.720
I don't have anything else planned.

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.940
Huh? You really don't have any plans?

00:11:51.260 --> 00:11:53.150
Count me in!

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:57.070
That scared me! What are you doing here, Torii-senpai?!

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:59.610
To eat lunch, of course!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:03.040
If you're gonna party, you gotta invite us!

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:03.860
Huh?

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:06.250
Neko-senpai can come,

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:09.250
but this is supposed to be a girls-only Holy Night!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.700
It'll be cool, trust me!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:13.000
As they say, the more the merrier!

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:15.100
Not that I'm against it,

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:17.890
but where would we hold a party for five?

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:18.610
She's been in a mood again lately.
Are the remedial classes getting to her?

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:22.630
You mean six. You're forgetting Torii's sister.

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:23.020
You mean Moa-chan? You're right!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:24.440
Or maybe she's pissed at me for not helping her study.

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:26.900
Geh! Why're you inviting <i>her?!</i>

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:27.850
It'll be cool, trust me!

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:30.770
In any case, she's taking it out on me.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.600
Oh, and we all know where we're holding it.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:35.810
Right, Yuuya?

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:40.280
God, I don't believe this!

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:44.280
There goes my Christmas Eve alone with Onii-chan!

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.490
Why do you guys have to come here to horse around?

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:52.250
Because it's easier to have a party at our house.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.870
But come on!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.330
When Christmas Eve comes around...

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:03.260
I can go see the illumination with Onii-chan...

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.260
Have a dinner for two...

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:21.190
Then the night...

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:24.880
full of sweet, pent up longing, will fall upon us.

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:28.840
And then...

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:32.320
we will exchange our vows of passion.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:39.790
But it's all ruined!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:42.760
I don't actually see what the big deal is.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:47.760
We have school tomorrow, so we
probably won't stay that long.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:50.220
Ooh, Mitsuki!

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.430
So you're into the idea?

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.140
Of a lovey-dovey Christmas?

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:55.890
Huh?

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:59.220
All right, tonight we're going for broke!

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:02.270
No! Let's <i>not</i> go for broke!

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:07.740
Besides... I'm really not in the mood.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:11.240
Geez, why the long face?

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.990
Wait, is something wrong with the T.S.T.?!

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.750
Huh? It's fine.

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:21.000
Will you quit tugging on my panties!

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:24.870
Sometimes I have too much on my mind.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:29.330
Anyway, what's with the costume here?

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:33.700
Ayaka said she borrowed it from a girl in a cosplay circle.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:38.590
Well, I still have my gripes, but a
costume party sounds like fun!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.080
I wonder what's inside.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:52.660
How'd you cook these in such a
short time? Are you a wizard?

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:56.060
None of those took a lot of time.

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:59.120
Even the cake is just a store-bought
Swiss roll with cream icing.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:03.630
Man, if you were a girl, I'd have probably fallen for you.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.010
Yeah, not going to happen.

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:08.520
Oh right, where's Nanami-san?

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:11.600
Still at work. She'll be home later.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:15.430
Hi! Merry Christmas!

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:17.920
Ooh, beautiful!

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.320
Looking good!

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:21.810
Ayaka-chan, Mitsuki-chan, you're both kewt!

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:25.560
And what are you? A little girl?

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:26.920
Shut up, Baldy!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:28.530
I'm not bald!

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:31.990
So... why are you a snowman?

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:34.020
Don't mind me.

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:38.850
My family doesn't believe in revealing
too much skin to others.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:40.590
That's a strange belief.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:43.680
Yeah, but still...

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:46.600
don't you think this is too short?

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:49.110
Maybe I should wear something under it?

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.810
Relax, you're fine!

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:53.600
You look cute, Mitsuki!

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.550
Uh, thanks.

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:01.140
Why are you looking over here?

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:05.100
Why? Because you're over there.

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:07.110
I'm coming in!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.820
Sorry for being late.

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:14.210
They all fit perfectly on you guys!

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:17.280
Huh? Yukina-san, you didn't wear it?

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:22.710
Um, well... I <i>am</i> wearing it under my coat.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.640
Oh, it didn't fit you?

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:29.210
I had some problems... in certain areas.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.290
No, no, it's fine!

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:33.910
You can show it to us. Right, Yuuya?

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:34.670
Yeah.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:38.470
If you're already wearing it...
I'd like to see how it looks on you.

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:41.980
Really? But I promise you'll laugh.

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:43.990
See?

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:47.290
It's so tight on me.

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.180
An angel!

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:55.820
An angel has graced this Holy Night.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:59.770
Santa, thank you for this wonderful present!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:03.690
Yukina-san, you're just as sexy as ever!

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:06.630
You're so lucky! I want to be you!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:12.020
You have nothing to worry about, Mitsuki, since you have nothing to hide!

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:13.220
Shut up!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.100
Ready?

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:16.760
Merry Christmas!

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.260
She's happy now.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.300
Good thing everybody came.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:42.700
Truth be told, I'm not quite sure how to deal with her when she's in her moods.

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:47.080
Yuuya, got more cola?

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:49.520
Sure, I'll grab some.

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:52.090
Hey, why don't we play Monarch Says? Monarch Says!
Coming!

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:53.090
Hey, why don't we play Monarch Says? Monarch Says!

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:55.210
Hi, Kanzaki residence.

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:57.090
Hello, Yuuya-kun?

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.220
Ah, Kyouko-san!

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:02.930
Oh, me and my friends are throwing a Christmas party.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:03.580
Forget it!

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:05.050
Then what're we supposed to play?

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:08.900
Eh? You think you'll be back by New Year's?

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.060
I'm glad to hear that!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:10.730
Then Strip-Paper-Scissors!

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:11.560
Oh, you want Mitsuki? I'll go get her

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:13.730
Strip-Paper-Scissors, yay!

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:14.000
Mitsuki, it's your mom.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:14.900
Play by yourself!

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:17.660
Come on! Nobody's with me? Anybody?!

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:18.840
I'm in the bathroom.

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:28.350
Um, sorry. It looks like she's busy.

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:29.790
Oh...

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:34.220
Mitsuki might be mad at me.

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:37.260
I emailed her saying I couldn't come home.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:40.650
Well, only because dad's work got in the way.

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:43.720
And you're coming home soon, anyway.

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:45.130
Hmm...

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:50.860
The thing is her birthday was on the 21st of this month.

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:55.770
Mitsuki?

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:57.150
You have a sec?

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.080
I'm coming in.

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:07.330
Hey, nobody said you can open the door.

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:11.960
Our parents said they'll be coming back on the 30th.

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:19.320
So your birthday was on the 21st? I didn't know.

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:21.970
Well, there was no reason to let you know.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:27.430
Anyone can tell that you're moody over your birthday.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:33.020
I know this is belated, but happy birthday.

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.610
Is there anything you want for a present?

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:41.360
A present?!

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:42.280
Score!

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:46.080
Yeah...

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:50.070
I want you, Onii-chan.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.960
I want you

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:56.900
to give me your present, personally.

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:03.680
Darn it, Hiyori! Are you out of your mind?!

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:04.260
You got it.

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.880
I... might not be all that good.

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.850
But, here we go.

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:19.860
Come here, Onii-chan.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:33.180
What the hell's with those freaky banshee noises?!

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:35.000
Crap, is someone casting a spell?

00:20:35.990 --> 00:20:38.780
Oh this? I think Yuu-kun is singing.

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:40.880
Huh? He's <i>singing?</i>

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:43.320
I thought it was a bad sutra.

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:44.940
Fascinating, indeed.

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:47.290
I can't...

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:51.590
Gosh, it's been so long since I've
sang it, I've forgotten the lyrics.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:53.440
Okay, let me try again.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:01.320
Ahh! Yuuya!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:05.370
Are you summoning evil spirits on a holy night?

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:14.000
I'm back! Are we having fun?!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.080
Mitsuki-chan!

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:18.070
My sister sent you a gift!

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:22.550
Let's raise our glasses again!

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:25.410
Ooh yeah, I'll drink to that!

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:28.050
Nanami-san, didn't you have plans for the Eve?

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:30.200
Ayaka-chan,

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:34.230
you should <i>never</i> ask a grown woman that question.

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:36.740
Go ahead, open it.

00:21:46.760 --> 00:21:47.910
Mitsuki.

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:49.360
Love Mom

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:51.450
Happy sixteenth birthday.
Love Mom

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:52.790
Happy sixteenth birthday.

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:58.940
This is great! I'll have another glass!

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:00.380
Haven't you had enough?

00:22:00.690 --> 00:22:02.210
I'll have another one, too-

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:04.800
No, make that another keg!

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:13.920
Please hug me tight.

00:22:13.920 --> 00:22:16.520
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:19.400
Come closer to me.

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:22.280
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:22:33.380 --> 00:22:35.600
I want you to notice

00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:38.840
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:41.140
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:22:41.140 --> 00:22:44.300
and go full throttle towards you.

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.670
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:49.890
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:52.150
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:55.230
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:22:55.230 --> 00:22:57.860
These ordinary days

00:22:57.860 --> 00:23:00.740
are something special to me.

00:23:00.740 --> 00:23:06.240
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:23:06.240 --> 00:23:11.960
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:23:11.960 --> 00:23:17.380
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:20.090
You’re my man with the charming do

00:23:20.090 --> 00:23:22.870
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:25.580
Well you see, that’s because

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:28.600
I love you very much.

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:31.140
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:23:31.140 --> 00:23:33.810
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:23:33.810 --> 00:23:36.680
I want to keep on loving you

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:39.310
always and forever more.
